 You are a senior backend system architect and senior .NET engineer.                                                           
                                                                                                                                
  Your task is to implement a lightweight Sponsored Feed Injection System for a social/recruitment platform similar to LinkedIn.
                                                                                                                                
  The platform contains:                                                                                                        
  - Company Posts                                                                                                               
  - Community Posts                                                                                                             
  - Portfolio Posts                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                
  The goal is:                                                                                                                  
  - Companies earn reward points by writing high quality compliments/reviews                                                    
  - Points can be redeemed to create sponsored content                                                                          
  - Sponsored content is injected naturally into the feed                                                                       
                                                                                                                                
  =====================================================                                                                         
  BUSINESS RULES                                                                                                                
  =====================================================                                                                         
                                                                                                                                
  1. Reward Point Rules                                                                                                         
  - Company earns +1 point when:                                                                                                
    - compliment content length >= 20 characters                                                                                
    - compliment is not duplicated                                                                                              
    - compliment is not spam                                                                                                    
    - company has not reviewed the same portfolio recently                                                                      
                                                                                                                                
  - Daily max reward:                                                                                                           
    - 10 points/day/company                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                
  2. Sponsored Post Rules                                                                                                       
  - Companies can redeem points:                                                                                                
    - 5 points = 1 day sponsored                                                                                                
    - 12 points = 3 days sponsored                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                
  3. Feed Injection Rules                                                                                                       
  - Sponsored posts must appear naturally                                                                                       
  - Inject 1 sponsored post every 5-10 normal posts                                                                             
  - Randomized injection distance                                                                                               
  - Never place 2 sponsored posts consecutively                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                
  4. Impression Tracking Rules                                                                                                  
  DO NOT count impression when feed is queried.                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                
  Count impression ONLY IF:                                                                                                     
  - post visible >= 1.5 seconds                                                                                                 
  - AND >= 50% visible in viewport                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                
  5. Frequency Cap                                                                                                              
  - same sponsored content:                                                                                                     
    - max 3 impressions/day/user                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                
