  =====================================================                                                                         
  FEED SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS                                                                                                      
  =====================================================                                                                         
                                                                                                                                
  Implement a Feed Mixer system.                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                
  Architecture:                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                
  FeedService                                                                                                                   
    NormalFeedProvider                                                                                                          
    SponsoredFeedProvider                                                                                                       
