  =====================================================                                                                         
  FEED GENERATION FLOW                                                                                                          
  =====================================================                                                                         
                                                                                                                                
  1. Query normal posts                                                                                                         
  2. Query active sponsored content                                                                                             
  3. Rank sponsored content                                                                                                     
  4. Inject sponsored items into feed                                                                                           
  5. Return unified feed response                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                
  =====================================================                                                                         
  UNIFIED FEED ITEM MODEL                                                                                                       
  =====================================================                                                                         
                                                                                                                                
  Create a unified DTO:                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                
  FeedItemDto                                                                                                                   
  - Type                                                                                                                        
  - IsSponsored                                                                                                                 
  - SponsoredLabel                                                                                                              
